  "explains": "Only api/openapi.json changes: the schema components.schemas.Money now requires currency. An operation changes when any schema it reaches through $ref changes, however far: listInvoices (an array of Invoice), createInvoice (NewInvoice has a Money total, and returns an Invoice), getInvoice (Invoice has a Money total) and getCustomer (Customer lists Invoices, Invoice has a Customer: the two schemas refer to each other, so the closure is taken with a visited set and ends) all reach Money; voidInvoice (only a path parameter, an empty 204 and the NotFound response, which holds Problem), downloadStatement, get and list reach no schema that changed. Four operations change: four routes, four operation-changed findings, and through the generated client of the web app four screens (the pages of listInvoices, createInvoice, getInvoice and getCustomer).",
